1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Death kept still.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A gentleman’s last argument with himself.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,150
The room had lied too neatly.

4
00:00:15,093 --> 00:00:17,543
A tear had lied.

5
00:00:18,093 --> 00:00:22,093
Wax does not climb into a draught.

6
00:00:22,093 --> 00:00:26,193
Truth had cooled where fear had moved.

7
00:00:30,162 --> 00:00:31,962
The rain hid much.

8
00:00:34,162 --> 00:00:37,662
Fresh oil, in this weather.

9
00:00:37,662 --> 00:00:40,662
But not the hand that schemed.

10
00:00:45,231 --> 00:00:49,681
Past sin rose under the boards and dressed murder as suicide.

11
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:06,300
The murderer never left this room.

12
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:09,050
Guilt stood upon the hidden door.

13
00:01:15,393 --> 00:01:17,943
The floor confessed.

14
00:01:21,393 --> 00:01:25,893
Lower your lamp, Mr. Holmes.

15
00:01:25,893 --> 00:01:28,443
Even time recoiled.
